              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "নামানো — nāmāno — \"to take down; to unload\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "অরুণ তাক থেকে বাক্সটা নামাল। ôrun tāk theke bāksôṭā nāmālô. Arun took the box down from the shelf."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he/she …): তিনি বাক্সটা নামালেন, tini bāksôṭā nāmālen."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The causing partner of নামা, to get down: you নামো from a bus, and you নামাও a box from a shelf."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "নামানো (nāmāno) is the causing form of নামা, \"to get down\", which CDIAL lists as Bengali nāmā, \"to descend\", under Sanskrit namrá, \"bent, bowed\" (CDIAL 6964)."
            }
          ]
        },
