            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ট্রলিটা আমাদের সব মালপত্র বহন করল। ṭrôliṭā āmāder sôb mālpôtrô bôhôn kôrlô. The trolley carried all our luggage."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he/she …): সেই ট্রাক মালপত্র বহন করল, sei ṭrāk mālpôtrô bôhôn kôrlô."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A careful word, common in writing and on signs; in talk people say নিয়ে যাওয়া, to take along."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বহন করা (bôhôn kôrā) joins Sanskrit vahana, \"bearing, carrying, conveying\" (Monier-Williams), to করা, to do."
            }
          ]
        },
